\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Market Increases; Sol Ends Weaker  \b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2005\par 22:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--The Lima stock indexes ended higher Monday bolstered by a rise in several blue chip shares.  \par \par \uc2 The stock market's broad general index rose 31.33 points, or 0.62%, to end at 5102.16, while the selective blue chip index advanced 64.46 points, or 0.80%, to close at 8073.30.  \par \par \uc2 Peruvian beverage producer Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus & Johnston SAA (BACKUSI.VL), or Backus, gained 1.0% to 1.94 soles ($1=PEN3.3450).  \par \par \uc2 According to analysts, shares linked to domestic demand like Backus are expected to continue to perform well in particular as the summer campaign gets underway.  \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company Credicorp Ltd. (BAP) also fared well in the session, rising a strong 4.0% to end at $29.77.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Peru's sol continued to lose ground Monday. The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the session.  \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the session at PEN3.3450 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3440-PEN3.3460, an official from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said.  \par \par \uc2 In the previous session, the sol finished at PEN3.3425 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3410-PEN3.3440.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.01% on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-03-05 1649ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020051003e1a30003u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichg