nd at $15.55.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 12-14-04 1707ET ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020041214e0ce00052\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
