ast year.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc-lead miner Compania Minera Atacocha SA rose 0.6% to end at PEN1.61.  \par \par \uc2 The company this week reported third-quarter net income of PEN13.4 million compared with net income of PEN7.8 million in the same quarter a year earlier.  \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company Credicorp Ltd. gained 2.1% from Thursday's close to end at $14.30.  \par \par \uc2 -Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-29-04 1721ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020041029e0at00043\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
