r.   \par \par \uc2 Telefonica SA gained 0.8% to $47.71, following the direction of its New York-traded American Depositary Receipts.   \par \par \uc2 - By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-18-04 1737ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020041018e0ai0003p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
