\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Market Hits Record High: Sol Strengthens  \b0\par\par\uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2004\par 23:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Lima's stock indexes ended sharply higher Monday, with the broad general index hitting a record high.  \par \par \uc2 A number of smaller mining companies led the gains, while some heavyweight miners fell.  \par \par \uc2 The broad general index rose 92.95 points, or 2.76%, to end at 3455.33.  \par \par \uc2 The selective blue chip index increased 166.43 points, or 2.97%, to end at 5769.51.  \par \par \uc2 Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) rose 8.6% to end at $4.15.  \par \par \uc2 Majority-owner Phelps Dodge Corp. (PD) said Monday that it had approved an $850 million expansion to Cerro Verde to increase copper output.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Volcan SAA rose 5.6% to end at 1.13 soles ($1=PEN3.3085) in heavy trade.  \par \par \uc2 Going the other way was Southern Peru Copper Corp. (PCU). It ended down 4.3% at $51.60, as copper prices eased.  \par \par \uc2 Peru's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and the bolsa were closed Friday for a national holiday.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Peru's sol strengthened Monday as demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained strong.  \par \par \uc2 The sol strengthened despite Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought $45.5 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed the session at a midrate of PEN3.3085 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3080-PEN3.3090.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.3255 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3250-PEN3.3260.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  placed PEN100 million in one-year certificates of deposit at an average annual yield of 4.54% and another PEN100 million in nine-month CDs at an average annual yield of 4.21%.  \par \par \uc2 It also placed PEN290 million in one-week CDs at an average annual yield of 3.06%.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.75% on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-11-04 1725ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020041011e0ab0002n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
