\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's Sol Weakens After  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 ; Stocks Mixed  \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 September 2004\par 22:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol closed weaker Thursday after the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $28 million.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.3745 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3740-PEN3.3750.  \par \par \uc2 The sol had closed the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.3720 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3710-PEN3.3730.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, buying, for example, a record one-day amount totaling $103 million on Tuesday, and another $15 million on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN50 million in 18-month certificates of deposit at an average annual yield of 5.29%, and another PEN50 million in one-year CDs at an average annual yield of 4.46%.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.70% on Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Lima's stock indexes ended mixed Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 The general index rose 0.03%, or 0.85 point, to end at 2843.83, the Lima Stock Exchange said.  \par \par \uc2 The selective blue chip index decreased 0.02%, or 0.99 point, to end at 4693.83, it added.  \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Volcan SAA fell 6.7% to end at PEN0.83 on weaker zinc prices.  \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Southern Peru Copper gained 0.6% to end at $44.00.  \par \par \uc2 The government has declared the strike by three unions at Southern Peru Copper's Toquepala and Cuajone mines illegal, saying the work stoppages don't comply with formal requirements.  \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner Buenaventura SAA gained 2.5% to end at PEN77.40.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par    \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 09-02-04 1647ET ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020040902e0920005t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
