 2850.68, the Lima Stock Exchange said.  \par \par \uc2 The selective blue chip index decreased 0.23%, or 10.84 points, to end at 4716.90, it added.  \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner Buenaventura SAA fell 2.6% to end at PEN75.00, despite stronger gold prices.  \par \par \uc2 - By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 08-31-04 1703ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020040831e08v0003l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
