\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's Sol Up Despite  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 ; Stock Market Gains  \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 August 2004\par 22:54\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol closed stronger Friday, despite Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $49.5 million.  \par \par \uc2 That followed a record \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchase of $83 million Thursday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tries to smooth out volatility from a strengthening sol.  \par \par \uc2 The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.3605 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3600-PEN3.3610.  \par \par \uc2 The sol had closed the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.3620 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.3610-PEN3.3630.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN90 million in one-year certificates of deposit at an average annual yield of 4.49%, another PEN90 million in 10-month CDs at an average annual yield of 4.21%, and another PEN60 million in 18-month CDs at an average annual yield of 5.27%.  \par \par \uc2 The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 2.57% on Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Lima's stock indexes ended marginally higher Friday as Southern Peru Copper Corp. and a number of smaller companies rose.  \par \par \uc2 The general index gained 0.04%, or 1.10 points, to end at 2,851.57.  \par \par \uc2 The selective blue chip index increased 0.09%, or 4.42 points, to end at 4,727.74.  \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Southern Peru Copper gained 0.5% to end at $43.00 on improved copper prices.  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and the stock market will be closed Monday for a national holiday.  \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 08-27-04 1654ET ]  \par \par \uc2 1071 1837  \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020040827e08r0005r\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Peru near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clb